LOCATION:560 Trinity Ave\, University City\, 63130
SUMMARY:WashU Holiday Celebration Concert
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a magical evening in the E. Desmond Lee Concert Hal
 l\,\nlocated within the 560 Music Center. Revel in the holiday spirit as\n
 the WashU Jazz Band\, Concert and Chamber Choirs\, and soloists present\na
  diverse selection of music that spans genres and eras\, all with a\nspeci
 al seasonal twist. From classic holiday tunes to contemporary\nfavorites\,
  there’s something for everyone to enjoy. Don’t miss\nthis opportunity
  to celebrate with music\, merriment\, and community! \n\nFREE\, family-f
 riendly\, and no tickets or reservations required.\n\n \n
DTSTAMP:20261119T182346Z
END:VEVENT
