 \, cello\nMatthew Gomez\, piano\n\nString Quartet No. 1 in G minor\, Op. 2
 7 (1877) by Edvard Grieg\n(1843–1907)\n     I. _Un poco andante – A
 llegro molto ed agitato_\nBradley Gober\, violin\nKyle Lombard\, violin*\n
 Delia Zacks\, viola\nColette Wicks\, cello\n
