SUMMARY:WashU Wind Ensemble Concert
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an evening of bold brass\, soaring melodies\, and
  the\nthrilling sound of the full wind ensemble! From Holst’s beloved\nF
 irst Suite in E-flat to the energy of _Play!_ and the dramatic\ncontrasts 
 of _Chiaroscuro_\, this program has something for everyone.\nThe concert f
 inishes in grand style with the unmistakable music of\nJohn Philip Sousa\,
