 phony on Themes of John Philip Sousa.\n\nDigital Program\n[https://wustl.b
 ox.com/s/we54zbdpult1sjqiany17237ocjmqore]\n\nWatch Live [https://youtube.
 com/live/NfCNq71GDoY?feature=share]\n\nPROGRAM\n\nPERCUSSION ENSEMBLE\n_Ve
 ctor_ (2020) - Matt Moore\n\nWIND ENSEMBLE\n_The Fairest of the Fair_ - Jo
 hn Philip Sousa\nSymphony on Themes of John Philip Sousa - Ira Hearshen\nF
 irst Suite in E-flat for Military Band - Gustav Holst\n_Play! _- Carl Holm
 quist\n
