 n Rowe (b. 1958)\n\n_Una Mas_ (1964) by Kenny Dorham (1924-1972) Arr. Mich
 ael Philip\nMossman\n\n_Come Sunday_ (1943) by Duke Ellington (1899-1974) 
 Arr. Mike Tomaro\n\n_Naima_ (1959) by John Coltrane (1926-1967) Arr. Crai
 g Skeffington\n\n_C-Jam Blues Ala Mambo_ (1942) by Duke Ellington Arr. Mic
 hael Philip\nMossman\n\n_Bodysnatchers_ (2007) by Radiohead\, established
