 celebrate the act of singing and the power it has to bring people\ntogethe
 r.\n\nWATCH LIVE [https://youtube.com/live/1IdvYk4GoPo?feature=share]\n\nP
 ROGRAM\n\nWASHU CHAMBER CHOIR\n\nJohn McDonald\, conductor\nYeon-Kyung Kim
