 n\n     Crystal Lovato\, solo\n\n_Go Down Moses_ (2026) Traditional Spi
 ritual Arranged by Nolawi Araya\n(b. 1995)\n\n_Sing Creations Music On_ (2
 001) by Stephen Paulus (1949-2014)\nArranged by Drew Collins\n\nLINDBERGH 
 HIGH SCHOOL A CAPPELLA CONCERT CHOIR \n\nLaura Swearingen\, conductor \n
