 harles Anthony Silvestri\n     Rachel Schrage\, solo\n\nWASHU CONCERT C
 HOIR\n\nJohn McDonald\, conductor\nYeon-Kyung Kim\, piano\n\n_I’m Gonna 
 Sing ‘Til the Spirit Moves in My Heart _(1995) by Moses\nHogan (1957-200
 3)\n\n_Refuge_ (2016) by Elaine Hagenberg (b. 1979) Text by Sara Teasdale\
 n(1884-1933)\n     Eric Liu\, cello\n     Christina Smiley\, solo\n\
 n_Your Soul Is Song_ (2019) by Jake Runestad (b. 1986) Text by Germán\nAg
 uilar (1980-2014)\n\nCOMBINED CHOIRS\n\nJohn McDonald\, conductor\nYeon-Ky
 ung Kim\, piano\n\n_Flight Song_ (2015) by Kim André Arnesen (b. 1980)\n
