 ple_\nto Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart’s Flute Concerto in G Major\, featuring
 \nflutist Jimin Lee\, winner of the Friends of Music Concerto &amp; Aria\nComp
 etition. A St. Louis premiere by Andrew List leads into Antonín\nDvořák
 ’s _American Suite\,_ before the evening concludes with\nHoward Shore’
 s music from _The Lord of the Rings_.\n\nDIGITAL PROGRAM\n[https://wustl.b
 ox.com/s/jaqnv01ctns6j1jf8eizm6jbunxhf6j3]\n\nWatch Live [https://youtube.
 com/live/p1JT2wu2Ssc?feature=share]\n\nPROGRAM\n\n_Dance of the Yao People
 _ - Liu Tieshan / Mao Yuan\nFlute Concerto in G Major\, 1st movement\, W.
 A Mozart\n     Jimin Lee\, flute (Winner of the Friends of Music Concer
 to &amp;\nAria Competition)\n_Sholem Aleichem’s Clock _(STL premiere) by And
 rew List\nSuite in A major Op. 98a “American\" by A. Dvorak \nSymphoni
 c Suite from _The Lord of the Rings_ by Howard Shore \n
