SUMMARY:Faculty Showcase
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a program featuring members of the WashU performanc
 e\nfaculty! Drinks will be served\, doors open at 7:00 pm.\n\nPROGRAM\n\nT
 rio for flute\, clarinet\, and harp (1958) by Elizabeth Poston (1905 -\n19
 87)\n    Jennifer Gartley\, flute\, Dana Hotle\, clarinet\, and Megan St
 out\,\nharp\n\nSonata for Piano (2018) by Bruce Stark\n     I. _Allegro
 _\n    Yeon-Kyung Kim\, piano\n\n_Three Smiles for Tracey_ by Adolphus H
 ailstork (b. 1941)\n     I. _Swiftly _\n     II. _Gently _\n    
  III. _Sprightly_\n    Dana Hotle\, clarinet\n\n_Ein Shwert verhiess mi
 r der Vater_ from _Die Walküre_ (1856-70) by\nRichard Wagner (1813 - 1883
 )\n    Nathan Ruggles\, tenor\, and Yeon-Kyung Kim\, piano\n\n_Grand Ove
 rture\, _Op. 61_ _by Mauro Giuliani (1781 - 1829)\n    W. Mark Akin\, gu
 itar\n\n_Grossmachtige Prinzessin_ from _Ariadne auf Naxos _(1912) by Rich
 ard\nStrauss (1864 - 1949)\n    Kelly Daniel-Decker\, soprano\, and Todd
  Decker\, piano\n
